/* winmm_exports.inc - X-macro list of winmm.dll public exports to proxy.
 *
 * Each entry becomes (a) a slot in the g_real[] pointer table and (b) a naked
 * tail-jump stub exported under the same name. A tail JMP is calling-convention
 * and arity agnostic, so one stub shape works for every winmm function.
 *
 * The game only imports waveOutGetNumDevs, but sibling DLLs (cocos2d, etc.) use
 * timeGetTime / timeBeginPeriod / PlaySound, so we forward the full public set.
 * Any winmm export not listed here simply isn't proxied; add it if something
 * fails to bind.
 */
